course_details.Learning Objectives:
● Observe the forms, genres, and styles of literary expression through practices of close reading and analysis;
● Gain awareness of the philosophical, cultural, and historical factors in shaping thought;
● Enhance spoken and written skills in literary and theoretical interpretation, analysis, and commentary;
● Sharpen powers of interpretation, critique, and aesthetic perception;
● Enlarge conceptual vocabulary to understand and express abstract notions.
